  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is supported by a massless string wound around a uniform hollow cylinder of mass m and radius R. If the string does not slip on the cylinder, with what acceleration will the mass fall on release?</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0231_9e52d72b6a74.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 245px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
