  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0231_d976c0064c62.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 237px;\" /><br /><br />mg - T&nbsp;= ma &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;----- 1<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0231_3b10105691cf.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 180px;\" /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>TR = I&#945;</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>TR</mn> <mo>=</mo><msup><mn>mR</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mn>&#945;</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />​<math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>mR</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;----2<br /><br />For no slippping<br /><br />a&nbsp;= R&alpha;&nbsp; ---3<br /><br />putting (3) in (2)&nbsp;<br /><br />T&nbsp;= ma ---4<br /><br />Adding 1 and 4<br /><br />mg = 2ma<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>&#8756;</mn> <mn>&#160; a</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>g</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>"
